---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /
title: "Home"
isHome: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-slide active" style="background-image:url('https://i.imgur.com/9hipxIq.jpeg')"></div>
  <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image:url('https://i.imgur.com/unrEyBt.jpeg')"></div>
  <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image:url('https://i.imgur.com/GUpNBaO.jpeg')"></div>
  <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image:url('https://i.imgur.com/KAOdHyM.jpeg')"></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <p class="hero-kicker">Salvation, West Virginia &middot; The Terrace</p>
    <h1>{{ school.name }}</h1>
    <p>L'unico istituto scolastico della città, dalla sesta alla dodicesima classe. Casa dei Salvation Bucks dal {{ school.founded }}.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/about/">Scopri la scuola</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/students-families/chiusure-ritardi/">Chiusure e ritardi</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
  <div class="home-section-head">
    <h2>Collegamenti rapidi</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="quicklinks">
    <a class="quicklink" href="/students-families/chiusure-ritardi/">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i>
      <div>
        <h4>Chiusure e ritardi</h4>
        <p>Stato delle lezioni in caso di neve o maltempo</p>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="quicklink" href="/students-families/calendario/">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-days"></i>
      <div>
        <h4>Calendario {{ school.schoolYear }}</h4>
        <p>Orari, vacanze e date importanti</p>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="quicklink" href="/students-families/mensa/">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-utensils"></i>
      <div>
        <h4>Menù mensa</h4>
        <p>Il menù settimanale della cafeteria</p>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="quicklink" href="/about/staff/">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-address-book"></i>
      <div>
        <h4>Staff Directory</h4>
        <p>Contatti di insegnanti e uffici</p>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="quicklink" href="/library/">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-book"></i>
      <div>
        <h4>Salvation Public Library</h4>
        <p>Orari scolastici e pubblici</p>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="quicklink" href="/athletics/football/">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-football"></i>
      <div>
        <h4>Salvation Bucks Football</h4>
        <p>Calendario partite e Friday Night Lights</p>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section tinted">
  <div class="home-section-head">
    <h2>Bacheca avvisi</h2>
    <a class="see-all" href="/news/">Tutti gli avvisi &rarr;</a>
  </div>
  <ul class="news-list">
    {% for item in collections.news %}
      {% if loop.index <= 5 %}
      <li>
        <span class="news-date">{{ item.data.date | readableDate }}</span>
        <span class="news-cat">{{ item.data.category }}</span>
        <a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a>
      </li>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="spotlight spotlight-dark" style="background-image:url('https://i.imgur.com/bJIwHae.jpeg')">
  <div class="spotlight-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Friday Night Lights</p>
    <h2>I Salvation Bucks</h2>
    <p>Ogni venerdì sera d'autunno, quando i Bucks giocano in casa, tutta Salvation converge al campo sopra The Terrace. Una tradizione che dura dal 1927, tra le più sentite della città.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/athletics/football/">Squadra, calendario e storia &rarr;</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
  <div class="home-section-head">
    <h2>La scuola</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-grid">
    <a class="content-card" href="/about/">
      <div class="thumb" style="background-image:url('https://i.imgur.com/mxlCGco.jpeg')"></div>
      <div class="body">
        <h4>Chi siamo</h4>
        <p>Storia, missione e tradizioni della scuola dal 1889 a oggi.</p>
        <span class="go">Scopri di più &rarr;</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="content-card" href="/academics/">
      <div class="thumb" style="background-image:url('https://i.imgur.com/QZIcD4n.jpeg')"></div>
      <div class="body">
        <h4>Programmi accademici</h4>
        <p>Dipartimenti, laboratori scientifici e percorsi vocazionali.</p>
        <span class="go">Scopri di più &rarr;</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="content-card" href="/library/">
      <div class="thumb" style="background-image:url('https://i.imgur.com/9xoaVmR.png')"></div>
      <div class="body">
        <h4>Salvation Public Library</h4>
        <p>Biblioteca scolastica e comunale, nell'ala nord-ovest del complesso.</p>
        <span class="go">Scopri di più &rarr;</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
